    if guestReadOnly
      | You are trying the demo as a guest: run its models, or design your own and download it.
      | 
      a(href='/signup') Sign up
      |  to save yours and run it here.
      |  Scripts run in a sandbox; timers and service tasks do not run in this demo.
    else
      | You are trying the demo as a guest: your models are kept for this browser.
      | Scripts run in a sandbox; timers and service tasks do not run in this demo.
      |
      a(href='/model/export') Download your models
